">My address is ... <br />My e-mail is ...</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'd like to book a flight to Sydney, Australia please.<br />A one- way ticket from Boston to Australia. How much is it?<br />My credit card number is 2345 9066 5743.  The expiry date is April 2023.<br />My e-mail address is correybrown@mail.com."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to book "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make arrangements for a specific time in the future. "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I would like to book a flight to Mexico in May."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob06aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when you book a flight."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "direct flight "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "going straight from one place to another without stopping  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Is there a direct flight to Mexico?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob06aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "one-way "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "travelling from one place to another, but not back again "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Would you like a one-way ticket?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob06aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "round-trip "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "travelling from one place to another and back to where you started "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Would you like a round-trip ticket?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob06aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "co